    "name": "OpticParse \u2014 Visual Zero-CSS Web Scraper API",
    "description": "### OpticParse \u2014 Multimodal Vision Web Scraper for AI Agents & Developers\n\nOpticParse reasons over web page layouts using edge multimodal vision rather than brittle CSS selectors, achieving **96% token noise reduction** and automated bypass of Cloudflare challenges.\n\n### \u26a1 Free Trial Quota\nEvery developer receives **200 free trial requests** out-of-the-box. \n- Headers returned on each call: `X-OpticParse-Trial-Limit` and `X-OpticParse-Trial-Remaining`.\n- Once 200 requests are exhausted, the endpoint responds with `HTTP 402 Payment Required` with instant Stripe and Web3 credit pack options.\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Treasury Settlement (x402 Protocol)\n- **Settlement Wallet:** `0xd458E709e7d54fd3659EF66624A621Cde74EDD27` (Base / Polygon / Arbitrum)\n- **Direct Pay-per-Call:** Send $0.05 USDC with transaction hash in header `X-Payment-TxHash`.\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 Client Packages:\n- PyPI: `pip install langchain-opticparse` / `pip install llama-index-tools-opticparse`\n- npm: `npm install opticparse-eliza-plugin`\n- GitHub: https://github.com/parastejpal987-cmyk/opticparse-public\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "createdAt": "2026-08-30T18:42:15.000Z",
